(7089612, 1079941, 30861, '<td valign="top">The placement of the horizon here is quite uncomfortable. In all other respects the image is striking. I''d wonder about using more foreground and less sky, myself, and processing up a little the foreground greens and violets. Still, lovely image.</td>', 'The placement of the horizon here is quite uncomfortable. In all other respects the image is striking. I''d wonder about using more foreground and less sky, myself, and processing up a little the foreground greens and violets. Still, lovely image.', '2013-08-19 12:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
