(7090003, 1079978, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great scene, love the vivid grass.</td>', 'Great scene, love the vivid grass.', '2013-08-20 06:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090005, 1079791, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not sure about this PP, maybe a bit to much HDR.<br/>Great scene though and the vertical crop enhances this.</td>', 'Not sure about this PP, maybe a bit to much HDR.Great scene though and the vertical crop enhances this.', '2013-08-20 06:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090021, 1079925, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely backlight, well composed breaking up the scene. Love the space created within his enviroment. makeing the boring dead in to something really natural and interesting.</td>', 'Lovely backlight, well composed breaking up the scene. Love the space created within his enviroment. makeing the boring dead in to something really natural and interesting.', '2013-08-20 07:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090050, 1079802, 134859, '<td valign="top">This would have to be my 2nd pick in the challenge.  I really love the amount of land and sky included in this image.  The depth is wonderful.  The light layer of mist/fog on the top of the water works wonderfully in this image.  Great colors and nice editing used.  Very well done.  Bumping to an 8</td>', 'This would have to be my 2nd pick in the challenge.  I really love the amount of land and sky included in this image.  The depth is wonderful.  The light layer of mist/fog on the top of the water works wonderfully in this image.  Great colors and nice editing used.  Very well done.  Bumping to an 8', '2013-08-20 11:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090053, 1079941, 134859, '<td valign="top">This would have to be my third favorite in the challenge.  LOVE the colors of the sky, the foreground is beautiful as well.  Its a very serene picture.  Nice composition and the landscape in portrait orientation works very well here!  Great job!  <strike>Bumping to an 8</strike> <br/>Bump to a 9</td>', 'This would have to be my third favorite in the challenge.  LOVE the colors of the sky, the foreground is beautiful as well.  Its a very serene picture.  Nice composition and the landscape in portrait orientation works very well here!  Great job!  Bumping to an 8 Bump to a 9', '2013-08-20 11:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090055, 1079792, 134859, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this higher, had it been uploaded in Portrait orientation.  <br/>Also, I think the foreground of flowers and stone don''t work well in this image, its more of a distraction than an enhancement.  Looks like you may have taken this when the sun was high, theres not much depth/shadows here.  I think it could have been a wonderful photo had it been a little better composition, and taken at a different time (or even edited differently).  <br/>But, I give you props for entering, because I didn''t even do that.</td>', 'I would have scored this higher, had it been uploaded in Portrait orientation.  Also, I think the foreground of flowers and stone don''t work well in this image, its more of a distraction than an enhancement.  Looks like you may have taken this when the sun was high, theres not much depth/shadows here.  I think it could have been a wonderful photo had it been a little better composition, and taken at a different time (or even edited differently).  But, I give you props for entering, because I didn''t even do that.', '2013-08-20 11:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090056, 1079190, 134859, '<td valign="top">This seems to be more Landscape orientation than portrait.  <br/>The sky also looks overexposed/blown out.  <br/>I do like the colors of the leaves, nice autumn feel.  <br/>A landscape orientation and better composition would have helped this photo.</td>', 'This seems to be more Landscape orientation than portrait.  The sky also looks overexposed/blown out.  I do like the colors of the leaves, nice autumn feel.  A landscape orientation and better composition would have helped this photo.', '2013-08-20 11:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
