(7090149, 1079570, 134859, '<td valign="top">Initially I rated this photo very low.  Simply because on first glance, it didn''t seem like a "landscape".  <br/>When people think landscape, you usually think of a field, or the mountains, or the ocean... some type of "land"... <br/>But... this photo makes you think... it''s an "urban landscape".  An innercity feel to this photo.  <br/>These types of photos are the reason I enjoy commenting... because it makes me think more... it makes me look "outside the box".  <br/>Love the detail.  You froze the action perfectly in this photo.  <br/>I truly enjoy looking at it... though I wonder how many others will appreciate it for it''s beauty.  <br/>Bumping score tremendously.  :)</td>', 'Initially I rated this photo very low.  Simply because on first glance, it didn''t seem like a "landscape".  When people think landscape, you usually think of a field, or the mountains, or the ocean... some type of "land"... But... this photo makes you think... it''s an "urban landscape".  An innercity feel to this photo.  These types of photos are the reason I enjoy commenting... because it makes me think more... it makes me look "outside the box".  Love the detail.  You froze the action perfectly in this photo.  I truly enjoy looking at it... though I wonder how many others will appreciate it for it''s beauty.  Bumping score tremendously.  :)', '2013-08-20 12:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090152, 1079980, 134859, '<td valign="top">A very different and unique photograph.  <br/>Initially, when "speed voting", I rated this low... but after a further review... I find a beauty in this photograph.  <br/>The darkness with the brightness, accentuating what appears to be dying flowers?  <br/>It has got a beauty that most won''t see.  <br/>A very intriguing photo... <br/>Well done<br/>A huge bump in score.</td>', 'A very different and unique photograph.  Initially, when "speed voting", I rated this low... but after a further review... I find a beauty in this photograph.  The darkness with the brightness, accentuating what appears to be dying flowers?  It has got a beauty that most won''t see.  A very intriguing photo... Well doneA huge bump in score.', '2013-08-20 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090153, 1079983, 134859, '<td valign="top">Overall, this isn''t a photo I really enjoy... but that''s just my opinion. <br/>I say this because the lighting seems harsh, there is a lot going on in the photo... and it appears to be shot straight on.  I think a different angle would have helped made it more interesting... and perhaps a different time of day?  <br/>But, you entered the challenge, and I did not... so you accomplished more than me here.  :)</td>', 'Overall, this isn''t a photo I really enjoy... but that''s just my opinion. I say this because the lighting seems harsh, there is a lot going on in the photo... and it appears to be shot straight on.  I think a different angle would have helped made it more interesting... and perhaps a different time of day?  But, you entered the challenge, and I did not... so you accomplished more than me here.  :)', '2013-08-20 12:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
