(7090673, 1079918, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of this Devonshire scene, with the transition to moorland, perfect for a portrait orientation. I spent most of my childhood in the West Country and my parents retired to the village of Dittisham not far from here.  I always loved going back. Keep your fingers crossed for good weather like this in mid-October when I''ll be back to visit my brother and his family!</td>', 'Lovely capture of this Devonshire scene, with the transition to moorland, perfect for a portrait orientation. I spent most of my childhood in the West Country and my parents retired to the village of Dittisham not far from here.  I always loved going back. Keep your fingers crossed for good weather like this in mid-October when I''ll be back to visit my brother and his family!', '2013-08-21 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7090730, 1079940, 92290, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here, especially with the clouds.  It gives the image a moody feel that just... resonates.  Awesome!</td>', 'I love the composition here, especially with the clouds.  It gives the image a moody feel that just... resonates.  Awesome!', '2013-08-21 05:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
