(7093308, 1079656, 12611, '<td valign="top">Its not just the location, there is an intangible sense of lighting, angle, processing, etc. that brought it to life. Pretty damned good location though. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Its not just the location, there is an intangible sense of lighting, angle, processing, etc. that brought it to life. Pretty damned good location though. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2013-08-27 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7093336, 1079243, 56502, '<td valign="top">Great shot.<br/> <br/>I think the reflection of the shooting star (or plane?) is simply not on the picture because of its location. Based on the reflection of the mountain top it would have appeared just outside the frame (or on the shore, so no reflection at all).</td>', 'Great shot. I think the reflection of the shooting star (or plane?) is simply not on the picture because of its location. Based on the reflection of the mountain top it would have appeared just outside the frame (or on the shore, so no reflection at all).', '2013-08-27 11:41:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7093398, 1079243, 112739, '<td valign="top">Congratulations my friend. Another well done night scape. Yes, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=56502" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bjoern</a> is correct. The reflection would be just outside the frame on the bottom right. Looks like there would be no water there anyway. Beautiful image!</td>', 'Congratulations my friend. Another well done night scape. Yes,  bjoern is correct. The reflection would be just outside the frame on the bottom right. Looks like there would be no water there anyway. Beautiful image!', '2013-08-27 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 0),
