(7093949, 1079941, 119169, '<td valign="top">I live very close to this place and i love it there. as much as i really do like this image, i still have yet to see one that really does the place justice. For those of you that have never visited the peak district i highly suggest you do.</td>', 'I live very close to this place and i love it there. as much as i really do like this image, i still have yet to see one that really does the place justice. For those of you that have never visited the peak district i highly suggest you do.', '2013-08-28 04:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7094081, 1079956, 161988, '<td valign="top">Just an awesome shot.</td>', 'Just an awesome shot.', '2013-08-28 10:05:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7094120, 1079792, 41802, '<td valign="top">Hi Alina, I remember seeing this image during the challenge and thought to myself that you either left the image rotated on purpose or you were new to uploading photos.  So looking it after the challenge I think you were trying to send a bigger message.  The photo itself is very nice.  I like that the foreground is in focus.  I have read a lot about how important the foreground element is in landscape photography, and you nailed it. The coloring is very vibrant and warm.  Great use of thirds on each level of the piece, the separation between fore, middle and background gives the image depth.  The blues are very rich and make me want to go to the ocean.   Nice work. <br/></td>', 'Hi Alina, I remember seeing this image during the challenge and thought to myself that you either left the image rotated on purpose or you were new to uploading photos.  So looking it after the challenge I think you were trying to send a bigger message.  The photo itself is very nice.  I like that the foreground is in focus.  I have read a lot about how important the foreground element is in landscape photography, and you nailed it. The coloring is very vibrant and warm.  Great use of thirds on each level of the piece, the separation between fore, middle and background gives the image depth.  The blues are very rich and make me want to go to the ocean.   Nice work. ', '2013-08-28 12:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7094127, 1080004, 41802, '<td valign="top">Hi posthumous, nice work on the landscape.  I remember this image in the challenge because it is so massive; the depth of everything is huge.  I like the subtle elements of light that pop up here and there throughout the piece.  I think you should great extra points for using a manual lens.  I dont think many people could use a manual and get this type of depth and clarity.  Your piece reminds me of something we would see in Black &amp; White magazine, where the blacks are so deep and rich.  Great work, I look forward to your future entries.</td>', 'Hi posthumous, nice work on the landscape.  I remember this image in the challenge because it is so massive; the depth of everything is huge.  I like the subtle elements of light that pop up here and there throughout the piece.  I think you should great extra points for using a manual lens.  I dont think many people could use a manual and get this type of depth and clarity.  Your piece reminds me of something we would see in Black & White magazine, where the blacks are so deep and rich.  Great work, I look forward to your future entries.', '2013-08-28 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7094470, 1079243, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The shooting star is  off the reflection. Look at the double star in line with the top  to the right of the mountaintop; it is below the shooting star and at it''s reflection is at the lake''s edge. The shooting star''s reflection would be in rocks of the shoreline.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The shooting star is  off the reflection. Look at the double star in line with the top  to the right of the mountaintop; it is below the shooting star and at it''s reflection is at the lake''s edge. The shooting star''s reflection would be in rocks of the shoreline.', '2013-08-28 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7095411, 1079698, 30982, '<td valign="top">Did you get the free boat ride?  I was stupid and went to work.  Gorgeous shot.  Breathtaking and peaceful.  And you gotta love the real cloud.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-30 12:20:32.</i></td>', 'Did you get the free boat ride?  I was stupid and went to work.  Gorgeous shot.  Breathtaking and peaceful.  And you gotta love the real cloud.  :)', '2013-08-30 13:18:20.000000', '2013-08-30 13:20:32.000000', 0),
(7096576, 1079269, 109387, '<td valign="top">I''ve always seen this place photographed from above. With a different crop and processing this could be a top 10 image.</td>', 'I''ve always seen this place photographed from above. With a different crop and processing this could be a top 10 image.', '2013-09-01 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7096577, 1079978, 109387, '<td valign="top">Neat shot Dennis. Light was not super, but it is still an underrated shot.</td>', 'Neat shot Dennis. Light was not super, but it is still an underrated shot.', '2013-09-01 17:26:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7096578, 1079896, 109387, '<td valign="top">Your colours are your style... no doubt it was yours. Congrats on the red.</td>', 'Your colours are your style... no doubt it was yours. Congrats on the red.', '2013-09-01 17:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7096579, 1079656, 109387, '<td valign="top">Of course the location is SUPER, but still this is a very good rendition of the place. And the clouds behind the mountain makes it almost 3D :)</td>', 'Of course the location is SUPER, but still this is a very good rendition of the place. And the clouds behind the mountain makes it almost 3D :)', '2013-09-01 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7096676, 1079656, 3936, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, the man made forms of the city, carved out of the randomness of the mountains, is striking.  The clouds give a great indication of the elevation here.</td>', 'Beautiful image, the man made forms of the city, carved out of the randomness of the mountains, is striking.  The clouds give a great indication of the elevation here.', '2013-09-01 21:36:12.000000', NULL, 0);
